      "content": "thanks. i can try adding a wrapper like that. but since i can't easily run a heavy debugger, i'm worried about the overhead of tracking every single allocation. \n\nis there anything else specific in the code i sent that looks suspicious? like, is there a pattern i should be looking for when i'm checking the logs?",
